Z||000004||sjp777||06-03-2001||09:36 PM||||'bout damn time. We've been waiting all weekend. <P>Can I assume the 88gt w/T-tops on the trailer is the raffle car?<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/890sm_4.jpg"> <BR>88GT 5sp, in desperate need of an LT1<BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fiero88gt1/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/fiero88gt1/</A>||||reg||1
Z||000005||KissMySSFiero||06-03-2001||09:37 PM||||i lost a couple disks so as soon as i find them i can have more pics posted.  i took 10 disks and can usually get about 250 pics.  i had two blanks left. we had a great time.  the only thing that would have made it better was if they had the classes separated correctly.  my class(projects) had cars in it that didnt need any work.  mine needs a lot.  i was glad to meet a lot of new people.  i got pressured into buyin a raffle ticket too.  if you havent bought yours yet you better do it soon.  only 20 bucks.  not bad for a 66k mile 88gt with ttopss.  which i might add were very nice.  i got to ride in the car.  never been in a ttop car that was clean.  cant wait til the next big show.<P>------------------<BR>JOEJOE Aol:SSFiero <P>88FORMULA<BR>      <A HREF="mailto:SSFiero@Aol.com">SSFiero@Aol.com</A>       <P>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/FORUMSIG1.jpg">           <BR>"Kids in the backseat cause accidents,  accidents in the backseat caused me!!"||||reg||1
Z||000006||KissMySSFiero||06-03-2001||09:38 PM||||the trailered car was a 1200 mile gt.  the raffle car was under that one.  ||||reg||1
